---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="2020 Election Model | Wyatt Entrekin">
  <section class="project-shell">
    <section class="project-hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-kicker">Archive Project</p>
        <h1>2020 Election Model</h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          An earlier forecasting project built around polling data, state-level assumptions, and scenario-based
          evaluation.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span>Forecasting</span>
          <span>Statistics</span>
          <span>Python</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-aside">
        <h2>Project status</h2>
        <p>This project is maintained as an archive and reference point for earlier model development work.</p>
        <p>Code remains publicly available for transparency and reproducibility review.</p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <div class="link-card-row link-row-soft single">
      <a class="link-card tone-repo" href="https://github.com/wmentrekin/2020election" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        View Repository
      </a>
    </div>

    <section class="info-grid">
      <article class="info-card">
        <h2>Scope</h2>
        <p class="muted">
          The model focused on translating polling signals into election outcomes and presenting interpretable scenario
          outputs.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="info-card">
        <h2>What it emphasized</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>State-level input aggregation</li>
          <li>Probabilistic interpretation of close races</li>
          <li>Transparent assumptions and repeatable runs</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="info-card">
      <h2>Retrospective</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        This project helped establish foundations for later analytics work: clearer data contracts, stronger automation
        habits, and better separation between model generation and delivery.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="info-grid">
      <article class="info-card">
        <h2>Technical stack</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Python-based data and modeling workflow</li>
          <li>Polling and election input preprocessing</li>
          <li>Result summarization for publication</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="info-card">
        <h2>Portfolio context</h2>
        <p class="muted">
          This archive complements your active sports analytics work and shows how your modeling approach evolved over
          time.
        </p>
        <a class="method-link" href="/projects">Back to all projects</a>
      </article>
    </section>
  </section>

  <style>
    .project-shell {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .link-row-soft .link-card {
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-transform: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      min-height: 56px;
    }

    .project-hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .hero-copy,
    .hero-aside,
    .info-card {
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255, 251, 248, 0.92), rgba(250, 239, 235, 0.88));
      border: 1px solid rgba(176, 132, 127, 0.3);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 1.05rem;
      box-shadow:
        0 14px 30px rgba(82, 48, 45, 0.12),
        0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) inset;
    }

    .hero-kicker {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .hero-copy h1 {
      margin: 0.45rem 0 0.55rem;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.9vw, 2.4rem);
      line-height: 1.14;
    }

    .hero-text {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.72;
      max-width: 62ch;
    }

    .hero-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.48rem;
      margin-top: 0.9rem;
    }

    .hero-tags span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 30px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.62rem;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #5d3f3d;
      background: rgba(241, 216, 215, 0.86);
      border: 1px solid rgba(164, 110, 105, 0.34);
    }

    .hero-aside h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .hero-aside p {
      margin: 0.72rem 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.68;
      padding-top: 0.72rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(176, 132, 127, 0.26);
    }

    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .info-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
      font-size: 1.22rem;
    }

    .info-card p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .info-card ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .info-card li + li {
      margin-top: 0.35rem;
    }

    .method-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .method-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media (max-width: 940px) {
      .project-hero,
      .info-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
